{"id": "t006-001", "text": "Khadija's mum is having her hip replaced on May 14. Khadija is taking the week off to look after her and sounded pretty worn out about it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her hip replaced", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty worn out", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t006-002", "text": "Liam lives in Leeds now, in a flat above a bakery. He works for the council in planning.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Leeds", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat above a bakery", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "works for the council in planning", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t006-003", "text": "Remind me to text Javier on Friday at 3pm to see how his knee scan went.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Javier", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Javier", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 3pm", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee scan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t006-004", "text": "Caught up with Zoe and her sister Phoebe. Phoebe has just started at a law firm in Manchester, and Zoe is still teaching Year 4 at the same school.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Phoebe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Phoebe", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "started at a law firm in Manchester", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "teaching Year 4", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t006-005", "text": "Sadia's dad was admitted to hospital last night with chest pains. They're keeping him in until at least Thursday while they run more tests, and her brother Imran is driving down from Leeds tomorrow to sit with him. Sadia is trying to hold it together for her mum, who hasn't left the ward since. I should call her tomorrow morning before her shift and ask if there's anything they need dropping off.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "admitted to hospital", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last night", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until at least Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tests", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imran", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving down from Leeds", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to hold it together", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning before her shift", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask if there's anything they need dropping off", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t006-006", "text": "Marisol and Mateo are moving to Bristol on June 3rd. She has a new job at the university there and he's going to work remotely.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the university", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "work remotely", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t006-007", "text": "Dentist moved to 11/4 at 9:15am. Need to pick up the car from the garage before then.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Dentist", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "11/4 at 9:15am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "pick up the car from the garage", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-008", "text": "Lwazi said his brother Thabo had his appendix out on Sunday. He's home now and recovering well, but can't drive for a few weeks.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Thabo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had his appendix out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t006-009", "text": "Gintaras is vegetarian and doesn't drink. His wife Irina is from Vilnius, and they have two girls, both at primary school.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Vilnius", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "have two girls", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "both at primary school", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t006-010", "text": "Arjun has his driving test on the 12th at half 9 and is really nervous. Don't forget to wish him luck the night before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Arjun", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 12th at half 9", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "wish him luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the night before", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-011", "text": "Obi's surgery got cancelled again because they ran out of beds. That's the second time since March. He's been rebooked for July 22 at 8am, but they warned him it could slip again. He was very fed up about it, understandably, and his boss is starting to ask questions about the time off. His girlfriend Shanice is trying to keep him positive.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Obi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since March"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 22 at 8am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fed up", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t006-012", "text": "Noor told me Akira and his partner are expecting their first baby in March. Akira hasn't said anything to me directly yet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Noor", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first baby", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t006-013", "text": "Shanice works night shifts at St Thomas' as a nurse. She lives in Brixton with her cousin.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Shanice", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works night shifts at St Thomas' as a nurse", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives in Brixton", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t006-014", "text": "Picked up a prescription and booked the boiler service for Tuesday afternoon.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "boiler service", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t006-015", "text": "Asha had her follow-up with the consultant this morning. All clear, which is such a relief after the last few months. Must send her flowers this week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Asha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "follow-up with the consultant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "All clear", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the last few months"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-016", "text": "Milan's dog Biscuit had an operation on his paw on Monday. Milan was quite shaken, he said it was the first time Biscuit had been put under. The vet wants to see him again on Thursday at 4pm to check the stitches. Ask him on Saturday how Biscuit is getting on.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "operation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Milan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite shaken", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday at 4pm", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "check the stitches", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-017", "text": "Ahmed and his wife Nadia are celebrating their tenth anniversary on 9/18. He's planning a surprise weekend in Lisbon and asked me not to mention it to her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ahmed", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nadia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "tenth anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/18", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise weekend in Lisbon", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t006-018", "text": "Farid is a structural engineer at Arup. He's originally from Tehran but has lived in Glasgow since he was twelve.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farid", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "structural engineer at Arup", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "originally from Tehran", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "has lived in Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since he was twelve"}]}
{"id": "t006-019", "text": "Blessing's mum, Mrs Okafor, is in for a cataract operation on August 5th at 2pm. Blessing is driving her in and staying with her for the evening. Remind me to check in with Blessing the day after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Blessing", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Okafor", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "cataract operation", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 5th at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Blessing", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the evening"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with Blessing", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Blessing", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the day after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-020", "text": "Nasser started his new role as head of finance at the start of the month. Says it's intense but he's enjoying it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new role as head of finance", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the start of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "enjoying it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t006-021", "text": "Sofia's grandmother passed away on Saturday. The funeral is on October 30 at 11am in Seville, and Sofia flies out on the 28th. Her brother Diego is going with her, but her dad can't travel because of his back. She said her abuela basically raised her during the summers. I need to message her before she leaves and maybe send something to the family.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandmother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "October 30 at 11am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flies out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 28th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Diego", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't travel because of his back", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "abuela", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "basically raised her", "owner": "r3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "during the summers"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before she leaves", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send something to the family", "owner": "r4", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "send", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t006-022", "text": "Vera mentioned that her husband works for the fire service and their son is at Edinburgh studying medicine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Vera", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "works for the fire service", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "at Edinburgh studying medicine", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t006-023", "text": "Miriam's biopsy results come back Thursday morning. She's trying not to think about it. I'll ring her Thursday evening.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Miriam", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "biopsy results", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying not to think about it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday evening"}]}
{"id": "t006-024", "text": "Georgia's hen do in Bath has been called off. She and Tom have split up, apparently it was mutual. She seemed okay but I should take her out for a drink soon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tom", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "split up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take her out for a drink", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-025", "text": "Adaeze is allergic to nuts and shellfish. Worth remembering for the dinner.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to nuts and shellfish", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t006-026", "text": "Karim had a minor stroke last week and is at the Royal Free until Monday. His daughter Layla is keeping everyone updated. Must visit him at the weekend, probably Sunday at 2pm when visiting opens.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "minor stroke", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "visit him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday at 2pm when visiting opens", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-027", "text": "Imani got into the choir at the cathedral. First rehearsal is next Wednesday at 7pm.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imani", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the choir at the cathedral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "First rehearsal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday at 7pm", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t006-028", "text": "Chioma and her husband live in Peckham with their twins, who are about four. She runs a small catering business from home.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "live in Peckham", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "about four", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "runs a small catering business from home", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
