{"id": "t006-051", "text": "Georgia is a primary school teacher in Hove. Her partner works in IT and they have a rescue greyhound called Wilf.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Georgia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "primary school teacher", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works in IT", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "rescue greyhound called Wilf", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t006-052", "text": "Adaeze had her gallbladder removed on Monday. Her husband said the surgery went well but she's in quite a bit of pain. Send her a message tomorrow afternoon to see how she's doing, and ask if they need any meals.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Adaeze", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had her gallbladder removed", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in quite a bit of pain", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her a message", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow afternoon", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask if they need any meals", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t006-053", "text": "Karim's leaving do is on Friday at 5:30pm at the Crown. He's retiring after thirty years at the bank and his wife Samira is coming along for the first hour. Everyone is chipping in for a set of golf clubs. Don't forget to put a tenner in the envelope by Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving do", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 5:30pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thirty years at the bank", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samira", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "put a tenner in the envelope", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-054", "text": "Imani's mum and dad are flying in from Nairobi on December 18 and staying until early January. She's slightly stressed about having them in the flat for that long.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Imani", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying in from Nairobi", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "December 18", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "until early January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly stressed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t006-055", "text": "Remind me to ask Chioma whether her dad's MRI on the 7th showed anything.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Chioma whether her dad's MRI on the 7th showed anything", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chioma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "MRI", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 7th", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t006-056", "text": "Gintaras's daughter Ieva broke her arm at gymnastics on Saturday. She has a fracture clinic appointment on Wednesday at 9am. Gintaras is taking her and Irina is covering his shift. Ieva is apparently loving the attention.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ieva", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke her arm", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "gymnastics", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fracture clinic appointment", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday at 9am", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gintaras", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Irina", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ieva", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "loving the attention", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t006-057", "text": "Liam and Javier are flatmates again, back in the place on Mill Road. Javier works at the hospital pharmacy, Liam is still freelancing.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Javier", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "flatmates", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "place on Mill Road", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Javier", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "works at the hospital pharmacy", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "freelancing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t006-058", "text": "Note to self: the clinic called and moved my blood test to 6/11 at 8:40am. No breakfast that morning.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "blood test", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6/11 at 8:40am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "No breakfast", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that morning", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-059", "text": "Talked to Zoe, Khadija and Sadia at lunch. Zoe's mum has a hysterectomy on March 3rd and Zoe is staying with her for a fortnight afterwards. Khadija offered to cover her classes. Sadia mentioned her own mum went through the same thing last year and recovered fine. Zoe seemed calmer after hearing that. I should check in with her the week after.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hysterectomy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying with her", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight afterwards", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p7", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sadia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "last year"}, {"id": "p8", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zoe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "calmer", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week after", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t006-060", "text": "Mateo said Marisol has been offered a permanent contract. They're celebrating at her parents' on Sunday lunchtime.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mateo", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Marisol", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered a permanent contract", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "celebrating", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday lunchtime", "anchor": "e2"}]}
